 <rdf:Description rdf:about=''
  xmlns:acdsee='http://ns.acdsee.com/iptc/1.0/'>
  <acdsee:caption>Betelgeuseâ€™s light and line-of-sight radial velocity curves in the interval 2012â€“2023. The upper panel shows V-band magnitudes tabulated by the AAVSO, with times of photometric minima marked. The lower panel shows radial velocities from STELLA (Granzer et al. 2022), with times of radial velocity maxima marked. The systemic velocity is 20.57 km sâˆ’1. In each case, we show a smoothed-spline fit to the curves, from which the maxima and minima are identified. In the radial velocity data, we also show a best-fit sine curve for the long secondary period.</acdsee:caption>
 </rdf:Description>

